;; Campaign play only (level/campaign.ts applyLook, 0.4.28): World 5 is Simon's world,
;; Transylvania, and 5-1 is the castle's courtyard gate (`cv-gate`): worn flagstones, grey castle
;; bricks and carved stone under a starry night, the courtyard's crenellated wall with its barred
;; gates and Dracula's castle far off painted behind (world/theme-backdrop.ts); its trees are stone
;; statues and torch braziers, its Bullet Bill blasters black iron. It plays 5-4's hall tune.
;; Elsewhere (level select, ?level=5-1) it looks as it always did.
campaignTheme: cv-gate
campaignMusic: cv-hall

